{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08562","headline":"荅裴侍御先行至石头驿以书见招期月满泛洞庭 · 李白","name":"荅裴侍御先行至石头驿以书见招期月满泛洞庭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君至石头驿，寄书黄鹤楼。\n开缄识远意，速此南行舟。\n风水无定准，湍波或滞留。\n忆昨新月生，西檐若琼钩。\n今来何所似，破镜悬清秋。\n恨不三五明，平湖泛澄流。\n此欢竟莫遂，狂杀王子猷。\n巴陵定遥远，持赠解人忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}